. **SYEAR: daughter/son distance only assessed in 2001, 2006, 2011, 2016
. *       tab plj0122_h syear     
. *       tab plj0123_h syear
. *Given that the variable is only collected over a limited number of years, th
> e analysis is confined to the respective years.
