(27,416 real changes made, 27,416 to missing)
(27,652 real changes made, 27,652 to missing)
(2,392 real changes made, 2,392 to missing)
(28,236 real changes made, 28,236 to missing)
(28,257 real changes made, 28,257 to missing)
(27,555 real changes made, 27,555 to missing)
